Route Player_ItemToItemAction through a weak TrifoolBeat_MapMedallionItemAction
hook so Beat 2.1 can swap the item action of a medallion equipped to a C-button
(Fire Medallion -> PLAYER_IA_DINS_FIRE). The weak default is pass-through, so a
Shipwright build without the TrifoolPercent module links and behaves exactly
like vanilla.

Upstream parallel: scripts/patches/player_patches.c Patched_Player_ItemToItemAction
